   <text>
      <body>
         <list>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00001">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Adam did that, even though he didn't need to</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Adam abo kaalle mitine haaki, amayim abe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Adam abo kaal mitine haaki, amaye abe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Adam abo kaal mitine hayki, amaye abe</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00002">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Adam has never done that by himself</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Adam amayim isheh abeh miyaarhige</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Adam amaye isheh abeh miyaarhige</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Adam amayim isheh abeh mayaarhige</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00003">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Alex said Monica knew that he might have to do that several more times</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Aleekis Monika usuk amayim mangole gedda abo kinam teerhegeh tinem warishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Aleekis Monika usuk amayim mangole ged abo kinam teerhegeh tinem warishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Aleekis Monika usuk amayim mangole gul abo kinam teerhegeh tinem warishe</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00004">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Although Ibero-America is a larger language region, American English carries greater influence in the current world</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Ibero-Ameerika naba luqhahi zooba tekkemih, Ameerikaati Ingiliiz, kaafit caalamalle naba tabso leya</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Ibero-Ameerika naba luqhahi zooba tekkemih, Ameerikaati Ingiliiz, kaafit caalamal naba wahas leya</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Ibero-Ameerika naba luqhat zooba takko kiyah, Ameerikat Ingiliiz, kaafit caalamalle naba wahas yabbirhe.</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00005">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">An office building, with 22 stories above ground and 2 below, is under construction</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Baarhot bukalle 22, baarhot addadde lel 2 daraja le maktabti camaara ginniimak tane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Wuli baarhot bukalle 22, baarhok addad lel 2 daraj le maktabti camaara siraaximaa tane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Wuli maktabti gino, 22 baarhot bukahi mackanya kee 2 baarhot addahi mackanlih dhishodde geytimta.</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00006">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Are you wearing lipstick?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Atu wagaballe hayaanam hashshitteh tanito?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Atu wagabal hayaanam hashshitteh tanito?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Atu wagabal hayaanam hayshitteh tanito?</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00007">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Beat the egg before putting it in the soup</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Amaa lalimta tekeridde haytam warah zib</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Amaa lalimta tekerid haytamko basol zib</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Amaa lalimta terekeridde haytam warah utuk.</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00008">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Both Alex and Alice like to play golf</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Aleekis kee Aliis lammuk goluf digiraanam kixinon</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Aleekis kee Aliis lammik goluf digiraanam kixinon</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Aleekis kee Aliis lammii goluf digiraanam kixinon</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00009">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">But she said, We'd rather have Victory because we'll succeed in everything we do.”</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Ishe laakin: Nanu ummanimille nansaro kinomhi sabbatah sariigalla geynam noh tashshe” terhxe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Ishe laakin: Nanu ummanimil nansaro kinomhi sabbatah sariigalla geynam noh tashshe” terhxe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Ishe laakin: Nanu ummanimil nansaro kinomhi sabbatah sariigalla geynam noh tayshe” terhxe</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00010">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">By and by, the bitter north wind began to blow</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Amalle anuk, dhacuma waarerta le qilbat xaaxatti dhago erherhishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Mangum sugekkah, dhacuma qilbat xaaxayti yamrawwaxo erherhishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Dherh waqhte sugekkah, sirii qilbat xaaxaa xaaxaysho erherhishe.</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00011">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Daddy, thank you for raising me with such care</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Abba, ta gina le anoonoolih yi carhishshemih, gaab yoh isho!</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Abba, ta ginah  anoonoolih yi teynebemih, gaab yoh isho</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Abba, ta ginah anoonoolih yi carissemih, gaab yoh isoy!</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00012">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Dogs can't talk, but it's almost as if the puppy's eyes said, No, I don't have a home.</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Kaara zidhdhiimoona mirhiicaana, laakin ten intit: Maale, care malino yarhxemih iggida</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Kaara waanishoona mirhiicaana, laakin ten intit: Maale, care malino yarhxemih iggida</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Kaara waanishoona marhiicaana, laakin ten intit: Maale, care malino yarhxemih iggida</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00013">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Don't scream, or you're dead</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Mizeerin, hido rabteh tanito</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Mizeerin, ohoydo rabteh tanito</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Madeerin, ohoydo rabteh tanito</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00014">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Don't you want to know what happened to Joe?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Joo ayim kaa teseedefem taarhago mifadhdha?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Joo aye geyem taarhago mifadhdha?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Joo aye kaa teseedefem taarhago mafadhdha</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00015">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">George and Olivia said they didn't want to sit with us</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Jorjo kee Oliiviya nottaalih defeyoona mifarhaanam warishen</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Jorjo kee Oliiviya noolih defeyoona mifarhaanam warishen</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Jorjo kee Oliiviya noolih defeyoona mafarhaanam warishen</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00016">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">George said that he didn't have a plan</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Jorjo xagara luuk miyinem warishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Jorjo maxaggaro lii miyinem warishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Jorjo maxaggaro lii manannam warishe</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00017">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">George said that he doesn't think that Carmen really likes doing that very much</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Kaarmen rummah amayim abaanam mikixinamah alle iggidam Jorjo warishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Kaarmen rummah amaye abaanam mikixinamah el iggidam Jorjo warishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Kaarmen rummah amaye abaanam makixinamah el iggidam Jorjo warishe</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00018">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Harry said that he wasn't planning to go swimming tomorrow</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Hari beera zabboh yadaw axiggiruk misuginnam warishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Hari beera igiiloh yadaw axiggirii misuginnam warishe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Hari beera igiiloh yadaw axiggirii manannam warishe</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00019">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">He has no heart at all</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Usuk inkinnah naxrurta male</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Usuk inkinnah raxma male</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Usuk inkinnah Afcaado male</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00020">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">He never let her feel that she doesn't have her mother</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Ishi ina malem usuk caduruh adde miyashshaabbe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Ishi ina malem usuk caduruh ed miyashshaabbe</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Ishi ina malem usuk caduruh ed mayayshaabbe</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00021">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">He's not worthy of you</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Usuk atu akah missil tiya maki</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Usuk koyyah mimissila</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Usuk koyyah meeda</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00022">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">How many times do you pray in the (24hrs) day?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Atu lellecidde (24sa) ayidhdhale gedda tassilliye?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Atu lellecid (24sa) ayidhdhale gedda tassilliye?</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Atin lellecid (24sa) ayidhdhale gul tassilliini?</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00023">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I am lighting the fire</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu gira bololishak aniyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu gira bololishaa aniyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu gira urusaa aniyo</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00024">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I don't have anything better to do</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu amayimko tashshem abayah inkim maliyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu amayko tashshem abayah inkim maliyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu amayko tayshem abayah inkim maliyo</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00025">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I don't have to explain myself</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu inneh abem caddoysho yolle mitane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu inneh abem caddooso yol mitane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu inneh abem caddooso yol matane</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00026">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I don't like being around poor people</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu baaxentitti wakalelle gaxam mikixiniyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu baaxentitti wakalel akkem mikixiniyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu baaxentitti wakalel gaxam makixiniyo</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00027">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I fear getting married as I don’t want to get separated from you</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu kottako barhsimamko ciloh marcishimamko mashshiita</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu kooko barhsimamko ciloh marcishimamko mashshiita</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu kooko barhsimamko ciloh marcishimamko mayshiita</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00028">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I found that in the back of the closet</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Tamaa tiya armaadiyot caazadde geye</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Tamaa tiyä armaadiyot caazad geye</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Amaa tiyä armaadiyot caadad geye</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00029">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I hadn't intended to do that</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Amayim abo exeesebeh miiniyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Amaye abo exeesebeh miiniyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Amaye abo niyeh mananniyo</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00030">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I know it's inevitable</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu amayim miraacen kinam aarhige</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu amaye miraacen kinam aarhige</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu amaye maraacen kinam aarhige</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00031">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I must apologize to Jami</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu Jaami cafuuka kaa essero yolle tane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu Jaami cafuuka kaa essero yol tane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu Jaamik: Yolle mabbarhin akko arhxo yolle tane</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00032">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I pray five times per day</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Lellecidde koona gedda assilliye</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Lellecid koona ged assilliye</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Lellecid koona gul assilliye</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00033">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I still think we should have invited James to go with us</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu kaddih axeesebe gedda Jaymis noolih yadaw akah deecimneh nannaw nolle tine</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu kaddih Jaymis noolih yadaw akah deecimneh nannaw nol tinem kinni akkalem</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu kaddih axeesebe ged Jaymis noolih yadaw akah deecimneh nannaw nol tine</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00034">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I think I should tell Oliver where I've been</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Akkale gedda Oliiverih alle sugem akah warisho yolle tane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Akkale ged Oliiverih awla sugem akah warisho yol tane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Akkale ged Oliiverih al sugem akah warisho yol tane</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00035">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I was employee of the year for three years</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu agiro kin shaqhqhaalattohi ashshowa adooxa iggida beye</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu agiro kin shaqhqhaalaytohi ashshowa adooxa iggida beye</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu agiro kin shaqhqhaalaytohi ayshowa adooxa iggida beye</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00036">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I won't be able to finish doing this in a week</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Anu tayim abak baxuurolle bako mirhiica</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Anu taye abak liggidinal bako mirhiica</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Anu taye abak liggidinal abaysho marhiica</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00037">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">I wonder what Tommy will do</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Toomi ayim abo kinam cibra yolle tekkeh tane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Toomi aye abo kinam cibra yol tekkeh tane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Toomi aye abo kinam sorheh aniyo</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00038">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">If William does that, I will, too</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Wiliyaam amayim abemko, anu gantah abo kiyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Wiliyaam amaye abemko, anu gantah abo kiyo</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Wiliyaam amaye abemko, anu agantah abo kiyo</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00039">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">It was obvious that Jack had told a lie</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Jaakah zirab akah warisheenim mudhdhuk kuuk yine</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Jaakah zirab warisheenim mudhdhuk kii yine</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Jaakah dirab akah warisheenim mudhdhuk kii yine</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00040">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">James is going to be very thirsty after doing that</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Jeymis amayim abemko sarrah mangum bakhaaro kinni</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Jeymis amaye abemko lakal mangum bakhaaro kinni</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Jeymis amaye abemko lakal mangum baqhaaro kinni</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00041">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">My most beautiful mom, I can never be like you</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Yi casa ina (casiina), anu kotta balih akko caduruh mirhiica</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Yi casa ina (casiina), anu koyya balih akko caduruh marhiica</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Yi casa ina (casiina), anu sina balih akko caduruh marhiica</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00042">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">No one except Jacob knows what really happened</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Yacqoobko bextih rummah ayim tekkem yaarhigeti miyane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Yacqoobko bextih rummah aye tekkem yaarhigeti miyane</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Yacqoobko sarrah rummah aye tekkem yaarhigeti miyane</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00043">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">No one in my family can do that</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Yi xawazadde tamayim walaa inketti abo mirhiica</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Yi xawazad tamaye walaa inketti abo mirhiica</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Yi xawazad tamaye walaa inketti abo marhiica</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00044">
               <seg type="source" lang="en">Oliver didn't doubt there would be a lot of people there</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="North" lang="ssy-N">Oliiver amalle mango xiyaw sugoona kuuk yiniinimih shakke luuk miyine</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="Central" lang="ssy-C">Oliiver amal mango xiyaw sugoona kii yiniinimih shakke lii miyine</seg>
               <seg type="variant" subtype="South" lang="ssy-S">Oliiver amal mango xiyaa sugoona kii yiniinimih shakke lii mananna</seg>
            </item>
            <item xml_id="SAM-GTR-00045">
